# S1 probe 7: user room F1 (L-shape, reflex corner 3200,3000). Mains along v. Oracle layout 1 needs an RC-parallel timber on e3.
# Here the inner-wall boundary e2 is placed first (core's R19(e) style), then the e3 edge main.
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 5000,0 5000,3000 3200,3000 3200,4800 0,4800
timber 1 27 33 role boundary
timber 2 27 33 role boundary
timber 3 27 33 role boundary
timber 4 27 33 role primary
place 1 on 1 at-face e0 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-face e4 -u +n
place 3 on 1 at-face e2 -u +n
place 4 on 1 at-face e3 +v +n
